# Line-ending policy: LF in the repository AND in every working tree.
#
# Prettier enforces LF (`endOfLine: 'lf'` default) and CI runs on Linux, so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would fail `pnpm format:check` on
# every file before a single line is changed. Pinning eol here makes clones
# deterministic regardless of any developer's global autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary safety net for future assets — never re-encoded.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
